,{"@type":"Question","name":"How much monthly ad budget for jewellery in Udaipur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Boutique Rs 80,000-5 lakh lower end (Rs 50K-2 lakh India, AED 3.5-12K GCC). Growth mid (Rs 2-8 lakh India, AED 12-40K GCC). Enterprise upper (Rs 8-40 lakh India, AED 40-200K GCC — luxury + bridal). Rule: 12-20% monthly revenue for jewellery (lower % than fashion/skincare due to higher LTV + slower repeat). Wedding season (Wedding season (Nov-March) + Mewar Festival + Teej + Diwali + peak destination-wedding season) concentrates 50-70% annual spend in 12-16 weeks. Bridal-specific brands see 60-80% concentration."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Meta vs Snapchat vs TikTok for jewellery in India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"India: Meta + Instagram + Reels dominant (60-70%) — trust + editorial visual environment. YouTube 15-20% for review + heritage + unboxing. TikTok 5-10% growing (Gen Z fashion jewellery). Snapchat 5% (limited jewellery fit). WhatsApp CTWA + concierge essential 15-20%. UAE: Instagram + Reels 40-45%, Snapchat 15-25%, TikTok 10-15%, Meta 15-20%, WhatsApp 15-20%. KSA: Snapchat 40-50%, Instagram + Reels 25-30%, TikTok 10%, Meta 10-15%, WhatsApp 15-20%. Arabic-first for KSA + halal-safe jewellery messaging."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do jewellery ads need Arabic + regional-language creative in Udaipur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"India: Hindi + English essential. Regional-language (Marathi Mumbai + Gujarati + Bengali + Tamil + Telugu + Kannada + Punjabi + Marwari) adds 25-40% CPL efficiency for regional catchment + wedding-market cultural resonance. For Udaipur with Hindi + Mewari + English, native-speaker outperforms English-only 30-50%. Regional wedding + traditional creative essential for regional-heritage jewellery brands. GCC: Arabic-native + English + Hindi trilingual mandatory. Arabic-first for KSA. Halal-safe + culturally-conservative messaging."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What role does influencer + creator play in jewellery social?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Essential — jewellery is trust + heritage + aspiration + celebrity-driven. Micro (10-100K, best ROI, Rs 5-40K/post), macro (100K-1M, Rs 30K-2 lakh/post), celebrity + Bollywood + wedding-industry (Rs 5-50 lakh/campaign for celebrity, Rs 2-15 lakh/quarter for wedding-industry stylist). Jewellery-specific creator network: wedding photographer + stylist + bridal magazine + celebrity + Bollywood + heritage-influencer + regional-wedding-influencer. UGC rights + Meta Branded Content Partner essential. Editorial + Vogue Wedding + Harper's Bazaar Bride + Brides Today placement drives premium/bridal brand equity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we set up attribution + CAPI for jewellery social?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA click tracking. LTV/CAC/cohort dashboard weekly. Value-based bidding (LTV-weighted). Jewellery-specific: high-AOV conversions require server-side attribution + custom event structure. Home-trial + concierge + phone-close conversions require offline conversion upload to Meta + Google. Multi-touch attribution essential — jewellery buyer touches 8-15 times pre-purchase over 2-8 weeks. Triple Whale + Northbeam + custom attribution stack. In Udaipur, WhatsApp CTWA + concierge attribution structure critical because 30-50% of high-AOV jewellery purchases close via WhatsApp/phone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we control ad fatigue for jewellery social in Udaipur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Creative velocity + long-form + editorial rotation. Boutique 3-6/week, Growth 8-18/week, Enterprise 18-40/week. Additional defences: audience expansion 2-4 weeks, creative refresh 4-6 weeks (jewellery buyer researches longer, less fatigued), frequency cap 3-5/week, exclude converted from prospecting (retention pool separate), celebrity + editorial + PR content injection, wedding/festive/heritage campaign rotation. In Udaipur wedding season (Wedding season (Nov-March) + Mewar Festival + Teej + Diwali + peak destination-wedding season) creative fatigue slows dramatically because bridal buyer expands + intent 3-5x."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Peak-season spend concentration for jewellery in Udaipur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Udaipur jewellery peaks: Wedding season (Nov-March) + Mewar Festival + Teej + Diwali + peak destination-wedding season. 50-70% annual ad spend in 12-16 peak weeks. Wedding season (Oct-March India, Ramadan + Eid + winter GCC) dominates. Akshaya Tritiya (April India) + Dhanteras + Diwali (Oct-Nov) = mega-peaks. Pre-peak 10-14 weeks: baseline + audience-building + waitlist. Peak 4-6 weeks: 3-5x baseline daily spend + creative-velocity + celebrity + PR. Post-peak 2-4 weeks: retention + repeat + winback. Bridal + solitaire brands see 60-80% annual concentration in wedding window."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should we optimise for first-purchase vs LTV bidding for jewellery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LTV-weighted always wins for jewellery. First-purchase CPA optimisation compresses margin + misses repeat + upgrade + LTV cohorts. Jewellery typical 5-year LTV: Rs 25K-2 lakh (fashion + silver), Rs 1-8 lakh (fine gold + diamond), Rs 5-40 lakh (bridal + solitaire + investment). Value-based bidding + multi-touch attribution + offline conversion upload (concierge close) essential. In Udaipur with wedding + festive concentration, LTV bidding for bridal + wedding cohorts critical — bridal buyer becomes anniversary + Karva Chauth + Dhanteras + festival LTV compound."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD GrowthLabs manage jewellery social in Udaipur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-stack: channel mix per India (Meta + Instagram + Reels + Snapchat GCC + WhatsApp CTWA + concierge), creative production (in-house pod), trilingual creative GCC, sub-vertical creator + celebrity + wedding-industry programme, CAPI + Enhanced Conversions + concierge-attribution + LTV/CAC/cohort reporting, wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali peak-season campaigns. Grounded in ITD's 50-piece jewellery cluster + Fabelia case study . See Digital Marketing for Jewellery Brands . Retainer starts at Rs 55,000-2.4 lakh + ad spend separate."}}]}</script>
